window.products.push({"id":984003,"name":"Kromapolis Glass Window Film, Frosted Lattice Privacy Film,Non Adhesive Static Cling Door Window Covering,Decorative Window Stickers for Home (35.4In.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfJqqBdbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💯🔶Kromapolis Geometric Window Film🔶 is a high quality and can provide an elegant look for your glass. 🦋Advantages: 💕[Removable and Resuable] - If you want to tear off the static decorative decals, it will not leave any trace on your glass. No Glue but can stick firmly. And the vinyl cling also can paste on the glass again, it's resuable. How amazing static stickers technology. 💕[Good Privacy] - The frosted glass film have a good privacy, so you can use it for your bedroom, living room, etc. If you want to decorate your bathroom glass, you also can use it. Although not can give you the best privacy, you don't worry that privacy not get protection. Can't see clearly insidefrom outside. 💠Installation Steps: ◊Step 1. Keep Window or Glass Clean. ◊Step 2. Measure the window and determine size. ◊Step 3. If you need to cut,draw lines the window film with markers. Make sure the edge of the protective film and the glass surface have a 1cm gap. ◊Step 4. Wet the Window or Glass with water( Soapy water will be the best choice ). ◊Step 5. Remove the Static Film from backing protect sheet ( Please MAKE SURE you have removed it before you apply the matte window film to glass). ◊Step 6. Squeegee away air bubbles and redundant water with a scraper or hard card. ◊Step7.Cut off the extra film edges. 🍀(The window film only paste on flat, clean, and smooth glass surfaces.) 💠How to Peel Off the Clear Backing Film: Please wet one window film corner and use your fingers to twist it for a while to loosen the attachment between the window film and clear backing film. We have also attached a small sticky tape on each roll of window film for your convenience, and then press it for effective attachment. And then you are able to separate the clear backing film from the window film easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YfJqqBdbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kromapolis","source_asin":"B08NVPGBRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NVPGBRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NVPGBRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
