window.products.push({"id":984049,"name":"Boston Linen Co. Weighted Blanket for Adults (Blue, 48\"x72\"-12lbs) Twin Reversible Cooling Heavy Weighted Blankets with Premium Glass Beads Comfort Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RGBHUHtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use This Weighted Blanket on Its Own Or With a Duvet Cover; Great Gift for Every Age. UNIQUE SLEEPING COMPANION: The original Boston Linen weighted blanket offers a natural way to help calm your body for a restful night of sleep; great calming sensory heavy blanket for adults by simulating a gentle hug that wraps around you and provides comfort. SWEET REMINDER: Our weighted blankets adopt five-layered for optimal breathability and cool tactile experience. The updated quilting technology allows glass beads to be distributed more evenly in each pocket, allowing your body to feel the care of a mother or the company of your lover. Elegant Design: Our Ultra-Premium, Luxury Design and Precision Computer Programmed sewing method means every weighted blanket is made to perfection. 4.7”x4.7” smaller compartments for more evenly distribution + The three-dimensional lock bead sewing method for 0 bead leakage plus Finest stitching(2.5-3mm one stitch) to prevent weight shifting from one compartment to another. The Diamond sewn design brings luxury and style to another level. EASY CARE: Our soft comfy cool blanket is double lined and stitched. It can be machine washable on low, gentle cycles with cold water. Air drying is recommended instead of drying. Or you can use a duvet cover to keep your blanket clean easily and protect it. BOSTON LINEN LIFETIME PROMISE - Boston Linen is a kind of company that prides itself on providing the best ever customer service in the industry. If you are not satisfied with your purchase at any point and for any reason, you can return it with no questions asked. Our Customer satisfaction is our top priority and we mean it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RGBHUHtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston Linen Company","source_asin":"B083SM5TMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SM5TMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SM5TMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
