window.products.push({"id":984083,"name":"LOVENJOY 100% Cotton Nautical Anchor Pennant Banner for Boys Birthday Baby Shower","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MjX2BmxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LOVENJOY: we deliver love and joy for every item we sell. About the Product: This lovely banner is made of white cotton fabric and has 6 different patterns of anchors, campass, pirate's ships and treasure map, it is double-sided so that both side can be displayed; it will make the party more fabulous and delightful. A good choice for all occasions, from formal to casual. Craftsmanship: Each item is delicately painted with reactive techniques to make sure the banner has good colour fastness and wash fastness. Unlike other suppliers, the pigments we use are qualified and odorless, therefore the item we made is safe and eco-friendly. After the printing process, skilled workers will professionally stitch pennants together onto the string. It is pre-assembled and easy to use. Other: - Package includes 1pc flag bunting banner; - 7 feet of actual flags, plus 3.8 feet of strings, each flag measures 17*17*17CM; - Washing instruction: Ironing; No bleaching; Washing max 40°C, mild process; - The item is a handmade product, there may be a slight size difference from the size above;  - Basically no color difference between image and product, but may slightly vary depending on the computer display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MjX2BmxlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVENJOY","source_asin":"B079J1MKCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079J1MKCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079J1MKCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":984084,"name":"Bodum Classic Tea Press with Stainless Steel Filter and Lid, 40-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lYmTY2BuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tea and the British seem to be inseparable in our perception of English culture. When BODUM was asked by the British Tea Council to develop a new way of brewing tea we were rather proud. We set out with the goal to make an innovation in tea drinking and the simple BODUM tea-brewing system was born: boil water, place your preferred tea leaves in the stainless steel filter, pour in the hot water, let steep 3-4 min. or to your preferred taste and press down the plunger. The brewing process has stopped - no need to remove the filter - no mess - no burned fingers, only the true unforgettable and delicious taste of your preferred tea. The clear glass makes the infusion visible at all times, making it a very attractive table piece. Everything can go in the dishwasher, the jug (without the rod and lid) can go in the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lYmTY2BuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000GE2N5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GE2N5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GE2N5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
