window.products.push({"id":984381,"name":"DevoacTech Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Super Powerful Suction 33KPa Stick Vacuum 8 in 1, 265W Brushless Motor, Up to 45mins Runtime, LED Display Handheld","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DTNMfmChL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚡【New Linear Air Duct Design】- DevoacTech M100 made a new linear air duct design. The motor, dust cup and multi-cone cyclone are in the same straight line, which greatly reduces the loss of suction power. The motor spins at 70,000 rpm, makes 140AW strong suction power, which is much more powerful than other vacuums. DevoacTech aims to provide a high-end product at affordable prics. ⚡【33Kpa Super Powerful Suction with 2 Modes】- This stick vacuum cleaner can be switched between two modes: standard mode (18KPa for 45mins) and strong mode (33KPa for 18 mins). So it can easily capture debris, dust, crumbs, pet hair, and other messes with ease. Suitable for task on the hard floor and carpet. ⚡【 Brushless Motor & Less Heat】- This cordless vacuum cleaner is built in 265W motor to ensure a unprecedented suction up to 33KPa. Comparing with other normal brushed motors, the brushless motor generates less heat and noise, which results in more energy-saving and longer service life. ⚡【Long Runtime & 2 Charging Ways】- Our cordless vacuum cleaner adopts a 2200mAh 8-cell large rechargeable battery, delivers up to 45 minutes uninterrupted runtime in standard mode. If you purchase an additional battery, the total runtime can boost to 90 minutes. The battery detachable design makes it easy to recharge separately. Item comes with a convenient wall mount which can hold the cordless vacuum cleaner to charge. You could also remove the battery to recharge it separately. ⚡【LED Touch Screen & LED Lights】- Our cordless stick vacuum has an LED touch screen that displays the real-time remaining battery life. And you can switch 2 suction power levels by touching the screen. This design is more convenient and trouble-free compared with traditional button operation. The LED Headlights bright beams light up dark spots so you will be able to see dust and debris and effectively cleaning up pet hair on hard floor , dirt under the bed, couch, furniture and at dark places. ⚡【8 in 1 Multifunction Vacuum】- With an upgraded motorized floor brush, mini motorized brush, crevice tool and 2-in-1 dusting brush, the household vacuum cleaner can be quickly converted into a lightweight portable handheld vacuum or stick vacuum. Most of the cordless vacuums in the market could only work well on hard floor. We upgraded the floor brush to make it easy on carpet vacuuming. So this cordless vacuum cleaner can achieve versatile cleaning, suitable for cleaning hard floors, carpets,cars, stairs, beds, sofa and hard-to-reach places.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DTNMfmChL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DevoacTech","source_asin":"B0C7GVYXGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7GVYXGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7GVYXGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
