window.products.push({"id":984439,"name":"LilySilk All Season Silk Comforter/Duvet/Quilt, 100% Long Strand Silk Floss Filling with 100% Cotton Cover, Breathable and Warm, Full(76x87 Inch, Net ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":207.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJgLKXJHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★warm★ Lilysilk Hand-made Silk Comforter Filled With Premium Long Strand Silk Floss, Cozy and Comfortable for All Seasons. Cool in Summer & Warm in Winter. Decent Gift Especially for Anyone You Love. ALL SEASON DUVET-MULBERRY SILK FILLING & 100% ROYAL COTTON COVER: This All Season Silk Duvet is filled by 100% Long Strand Mulberry Silk Floss which resists breakage, prolonging the life of the silk duvet and covered by 100% premium cotton, very soft and comfortable. It is not too bulky or heavy like down duvet but It is warm in cold winter, breathable and not overheating in summer. EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP, DURABLE FOR MANY YEARS: SIZE: Silk Comforter Full Size 76''x87''(193x220cm), Net Silk Weight: 1.5kg, 3.3lb. BOX STITCHING: No Box Stitch to destroy silk structure, just long strand silk filling with special fixed techniques. Short Zipper on the side of the comforter for silk floss filling authenticity inspection, well made with silk stuffing evenly distributed throughout. Four corner taps are designed to secure the duvet in place. ENJOY A GREAT SLEEP-PROMOTE HEALTH: Enjoying a good night’s sleep is an important part of good health – Silks can help! These premium quality silk duvets from LilySilk feature ‘long strand’ silk threads. Silks can breathe, providing a consistent temperature for sleep. You will keep warm in the winter and cool in the summer Because silk duvets allow far better heat regulation than down or polyester duvets there is very little sweat produced throughout the night. REAL SILK FILLING, SKIN FRIENDLY: Silk Duvet Is Filled by 6A Grade long strand mulberry silk floss, Long Strand Silk Is the Best Silk Which Offer All The Benefits Silk Material Has; Super soft and smooth yet 3 times breathable than high quality cotton, best for skin care. Spot Fix Filling ensured No shifting while not damage the long strand silk structure. EASY CARE & HIGH STANDARD QUALITY - Silk Duvet Can Just be Air Cleaned every few months on the line or balcony out of direct sunlight, Do Not Wash It By Washing Machine. We Only Use Best Grade 6A Silk Floss.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UJgLKXJHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LilySilk","source_asin":"B01M5ECYUW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5ECYUW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5ECYUW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
