window.products.push({"id":984489,"name":"FURWOO Office Chair Executive Gaming Chair with Lunbar Pillow Height Adjustable 360 Swivel Leather Desk Chair Racing Style PC Chiar(Pink & White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51srBw5maNS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✅【Gaming Chair】Cushion: 35.5cm/14in x 50.5cm/20in(WxL), Backrest: 51cm/20.1in x 74cm/29.1in(WxH). Maximum load: 220lbs. ✅【Height Adjustable & 360 Swivel】Height lift by hydraulic gas from 46cm/18.1in to 56.5cm/22.2in, and the seat can be rotated 360 degrees. ✅【Comfortable Arm Chair】White and pink PU leather makes the seat look generous, wear resistant, and sit comfortably. ✅【Ergonomic Office Chair】The angle adjustable seat back has ventilation holes, ergonomic design on the curvature between backrest and seat, round arc smooth armrests, removable headrest and waist pillows, brings you comfortable experience even for sitting long hours. ✅【Smoothly & Durable】The wheels 360 degrees rolling smoothly without noise, and prevent scratching from your floor. Multifunctional chair is ideal for office room, club, gaming room, study, home etc. ✅【Assemble】Need one partner to assemble together, or it may not be easy.There is lubricating oil on the air rodThere is lubricating oil on the gas lift, please be careful not to get your hands dirty. 💕Check the height and size before placing an order. Make sure the selected color is what you want. 💕You need to sit on it and press it with your weight to adjust the height. 💕Please remove the plastic protective cover when installing the seat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51srBw5maNS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FURWOO","source_asin":"B08R5K5SCD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R5K5SCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R5K5SCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":984490,"name":"Kids Rugs for Girls Bedroom, Kids Rainbow Area Rugs Carpet with Non Slip and Fluffy Soft Design for Kids Play Room, Nursery, Toddler and Home Decor(6.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GFoZV01QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈【MOST BEAUTIFUL RAINBOW RUGS for GIRLS】The surface of the area rug presents a very vibrant and bright rainbow color, and the color is very layered. The Rainbow area rug has the perfect decorative effect in any room and can bring creative visual experience, warmth, and new vitality, so it is also a perfect gift idea for little girl. Meet the rainbow, meet the luck! 🌈【HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS】Our fluffy and soft carpets are made of hypoallergenic and environmentally friendly materials and do not contain any toxic substances. While ensuring the soft-touch characteristics of the carpet, it also resistant to fading and no shedding. The skin-friendly carpet is the best choice for children to play on the floor. 🌈【NON-SLIP BOTTOM DESIGN】The bottom of the carpet adopts a non-slip design. The high-density small and durable anti-slip glue dots increase the friction between the carpet and the floor to giving the carpet a certain anti-slip function, so you don't have to worry about it will move. The non-slip design can help children play safely on the carpet. Notice: the water under the carpet may cause the dots to fall off, so keep the bottom of the carpet dry. 🌈【EASY TO CLEAN AND CARE】The carpet is designed with short hair, which makes cleaning easier. You can use a hand-held vacuum cleaner or dishcloth to easily remove the dust on the carpet, or you can add some mild detergent or soap and gently wash the carpet with your hands. If using a machine wash, put the carpet in a laundry bag. Before the next use, it is best to put the carpet in the ventilation to dry. 🌈【EASY TO STORE AND CARRY】Our carpets will be equipped with a portable transparent packaging bag, when you don't need to use the carpet, you can fold the carpet and put them in the packaging bags to avoid the carpet from accumulating dust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GFoZV01QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartyKindom","source_asin":"B08K8QF4LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8QF4LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8QF4LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
