window.products.push({"id":984493,"name":"Sublibelief Knife Magnetic Strip for Wall - 17inch Magnetic Kitchen Stainless Steel Knife Holder for Refrigerator - Double Sided Magnet Knife Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yym24sBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔Upgraded Powerful Knife Magnetic Strip: Magnetic knife bar made of SUS304 stainless steel, has a higher corrosion and oil resistance. Knife magnet strip employs with heavy-duty magnets on both sides to provide extra magnetic strength, more more easily and firmly absored to refrigerator and attract knives and tools. Two ends of the magnetic knife holder for wall are completely sealed by laser welding. Moisture-proof, waterproof and rust-proof. ✔Larger Capacity Storage Magnet Knife Holder Strip: This 17inch knife holder magnet has an extended length can hold more knives than most other knife blocks. Using magnetic knife strip to hold knives, scissors, tools, keys and so on, it can store many items without too much space. This stainless steel magnetic knife holder is designed to look great in your kitchen or any rooms. ✔Three installation ways: Double-sided tape (no drilling installation) suitable for smooth wall ONLY, please leave it for 24-48 hours before use. Provided with 2 sets of screws and anchors for drilling installation to fit almost all surface. Attach the black EVA non-slip pads to both end of the strip back(NOTICE: Prevent sliding down, avoid scratching fridge), then it's magnetic knife holder for refrigerator. ✔Multifunction Magnetic Holder: Magnetic knife rack can be used in tool room, garage, garden to hang tools, and in entrance hall to hang metal keys. This kitchen utensil bar can be used as knife holder, knife strip, knife rack, kitchen utensil holder, home organizer, art supply organizer & tool holder, with 3 hooks for maximum storage of non-absorbable tools. Easily access your knives or tools without having to search all over. ✔90-DAY Replacement Service：Please be noticed that we provide 90 days guarantee on our Knife magnet strip. Within 90 days after items received, if there is any problem with the items, please contact us via order. We will provide replacement service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yym24sBiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sublibelief","source_asin":"B09VSXWS1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSXWS1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSXWS1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
