window.products.push({"id":984534,"name":"Vacuum Sealer with Cutter, 5-in-1 Dry/Moist Automatic Food Sealer Vacuum Sealer, Keep Fresh 8× Longer for Sous Vide/Meat/Food Saver & Storage, Starter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tw9zBQmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅Keep Fresh 8x Longer, Save Money✅ - For someone like YOU who likes buying food, meat, dry foods, etc bulkily when there is a sale. This vacuum sealer machine keeps food fresh for up to 8x longer compared to ordinary preservation. Perfect for bulk grocery shopping and leftovers. Affordable and work great. ✅Powerful Vacuum, Fast Sealing✅ - The food sealer vacuum sealer machine adopts a powerful suction technology, which is enough to take the air out completely. Built-in 0.4in heating wire, the 0.12in sealing width ensures the durable sealing effect. Takes less than 20s to complete the food vacuum sealing. Fast heat dissipation, and overheating protection which use for 200 times continuous sealing. ✅5 Modes, Dry & Moist✅ - 5 modes help you customize the perfect preservation way for all kinds of food: Moist/Vac Seal/Only Seal/Control/External Suction. Adopt the external suction mode, a hose attachment allows you to remove the air from canning jars or vacuum containers. (Attention: For crispy or juicy food like potato chips or pickled food, please select the \"Control Mode\".） ✅Easy to Use✅ - Automatic vacuum sealing operation. Just put the bag into the food save vacuum sealer machine, choose the right mode, and the vacuum sealer machine will vacuum & seal automatically. (Attention: Please confirm the opening of the bag is inside the vacuum chamber. The red light means it is sealing, and please wait for the red light to turn off.) ✅3-in-1 Design, Space-Saving✅ - The food sealer vacuum sealer adds a bag cutter and roll storage, measured 13in x5in x2in. Takes less countertop space, but makes super-efficient use of storage space, whether in your freezer, fridge, or pantry. With the external bag cutter, you can easily make custom-sized bags without scissors. (Fits up to 11.8in width bags).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tw9zBQmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LyriFine","source_asin":"B0B5LG8VNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5LG8VNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5LG8VNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
