window.products.push({"id":984587,"name":"Large Ouija Coffee Mug by Rogue + Wolf Witch Goth Accessories for Women Hocus Pocus Gothic Home Decor Unique Spooky Witchy Gifts Cute Halloween Mugs W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a4lF8blGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🖤 Design: Large black coffee mug perfect for your witches brew or Gothic kitchen decor. Witchy Ouija Board design within makes these cute mugs wonderfully spooky unique gifts for women & men. If you're looking for witchcraft supplies, goth accessories or just some interesting finds this is for you. Add a bit of hocus pocus to your witch moon decor or make the witch in your life very happy with this extra witchy tea cup come soup bowl. Excellent Halloween, birthday and even Christmas gifts! ☕ Style & Versatility: Add some occult witchy vibes to your morning coffee ritual with this large mug, or use as a soup mug and make those Winter nights extra spooky! Large enough for your breakfast cereal, evening meal or just a generous iced coffee or green tea! Or put with your gothic office decor or display on your home coffee bar. Looks great on your altar with your wiccan supplies and tools and other witch stuff, or pop on your bookshelf with your other cool things and hocus pocus decor! 🖤 Superior Quality: At Rogue + Wolf, we focus on customer care and pride ourselves at producing the best quality products & spooky gifts and keeping our fans & customers happy. We spared no expense in making our tea & coffee mugs & Witch accessories for women. We topped it all up with designing the most enchanting Spirit Board Box decorated with Moons & Stars, ready to enthral you or make an amazing witchy gift! Cool things & Cute Gifts need to be quality so you gift with confidence! ☕ Size & Material: Black porcelain tea mug keeps your coffee & tea hot for longer. Microwave & dishwasher safe and shaped so that it's comfortable to hold. Shiny gloss finish all over for a luxurious feel. It’s smooth, durable & easy to wash. This coffee cup holds a huge 500ml, 17.6oz of your delicious hot chocolate, latte or warm pumpkin soup on those cold nights. Or use it with your spooky goth decor to store your aesthetic accessories, healing crystals or hocus pocus makeup! H 8cm x W 12.3cm 🖤 Satisfaction: We offer 90 days money back, 12 months manufacturer warranty for replacement and friendly customer service. Write to us if you encounter any issues, we will always try our hardest to help, solve any issues fast, answer your questions and above all, keep a big smile on your face! Please email us if you have any problem with an item, we will go out of our way to make sure you get what you bought or you are left happy with your purchase","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a4lF8blGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rogue + Wolf","source_asin":"B08DRJ49NZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DRJ49NZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DRJ49NZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
