window.products.push({"id":984721,"name":"Cauldryn Coffee Smart Mug, Heated Travel Mug with 10 Hour Battery Life and Bluetooth App Temperature Control, 16 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9rW2Q1OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cauldryn Coffee Smart Mug will keep your coffee or tea at the perfect temperature with its rechargeable battery that offers up to 10 hours of temperature control. The long-lasting battery and 16 ounce capacity make this mug ideal for road trips, days at the office or in a tree stand, and weekend campers. The Cauldryn Coffee Smart Mug pairs with the Cauldryn app via a Bluetooth connection. You can control the temperature of your beverage with the app, which offers preset temperatures for green tea, black tea, brewing coffee, boiling water, and cooking freeze dried food on the home screen. You can manually control the temperature of your coffee with the app’s custom dial control. Once you set the mug’s temperature, it will regulate automatically even if you disconnect your phone. The temperature can also be set using the buttons on the right side of the LCD display. The top button to the left of the display controls the power saving mode, and the bottom button toggles the temperature unit from Fahrenheit to Celsius. The battery and heating element are removable for easy cleaning; the mug is hand wash only. The battery power level is displayed through the procession of 4 lights under the power button on the battery. The Cauldryn Coffee Smart Mug offers plenty of heating power so you can enjoy your preferred beverage at the perfect temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9rW2Q1OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cauldryn","source_asin":"B07GGLQLMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GGLQLMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GGLQLMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":984722,"name":"Rainmae 7 Pcs Baroque Fondant Silicone Molds, Relief Flower Lace Chocolate Mould, Scroll Lace Clay Mold, Filigree Mold 3D Sculpted Decoration, Cupcake","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EwVB-ExL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rainmae 7 Pcs Baroque Fondant Silicone Molds, Relief Flower Lace Chocolate Mould, Scroll Lace Clay Mold, Filigree Mold 3D Sculpted Decoration, Cupcake Topper, Jewelry, Polymer Clay, Crafting Projects Wide Application:  This tool will help bring your crafting or cake decorating skills to a new level, ideal for use with a wide range of edible and non edible materials, can be applied for making cake or cupcake decoration, candy, chocolate, fondant, ice cube, cookie, jelly and more.  Durable to use:  Made of quality silicone material, durable and flexible to use, heat resistance up to 446 degrees Fahrenheit, cold resistance can reach -40 degrees Fahrenheit, microwave safe, oven safe, and dishwasher safe.  Specifications:  Material: silicone  Color: as pictures shown  Size: as pictures shown Package includes:  7 x Baroque Style silicone molds  Use and maintenance: —After each use, wash in the dishwasher or use hot water to clean. Make sure the silicone mold clean before each use and dry completely before storage.  —The silicon mold can be applied only for the oven, oven and microwave oven, never can be placed directly on the gas stove and induction cooker, or direct heating use.  —The silicone mold is dust absorptive, you put in the carton, placed in the shade when you don't use it for long time.  —It is best to apply a little butter or oil before making.  Note: 1.Due to the display, camera, or other factors, there may be some chromatic aberrat. 2.Safe to use in ovens, microwaves, freezers and dishwashers. 3.Do not use the knife or other sharp instruments on the silicone mold, not weight, pulling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710EwVB-ExL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rainmae","source_asin":"B09YRHMGWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YRHMGWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YRHMGWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
