window.products.push({"id":984770,"name":"LINLUX 70\" Modern Upholstered Sofa Couch, Couches for Living Room Sectional Sofas w/3 Pillows and Iron Legs, Linen Fabric Couch for Small Spaces, Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZrIO0dG2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dimension】 Assemble Size：70.47'' W x 26.37'' D x 29.92'' H. Weight Capacity: 700 lbs. Assemble in 15 mins. 【Modern Minimalist Design】 This 3-seat small sofa couch is made of linen fabric and equipped with metal legs which feature a minimalist modern style. It will be a beautiful and complementary addition to your home or office space. Perfect as a bedroom sofa, living room sofa, office sofa, RV sofa 【Sturdy Structure Sofa】 Stable and durable springs with great resilience and strength, won't collapse when you sit down. The wooden frame and 4 metal legs are sturdy enough to bear 700lbs. The anti-slip pads enhance stability and prevent scratching your floor and carpet 【Comfy Small Couch】 - High-resilient sponge padded seat and soft backrest with breathable linen surface provides relaxation of your entire body. 2 plump armrest pillows of this love seat can relax your hands, protect your head or support your waist 【Tool Free Assembly】 All parts and instructions are packed into one box. Just assemble the armrests, back and the metal legs, for easy assembly in less than 15 mins. You can enjoy this thickened deep 3 seat modern sofa right away. 【Easy Care】 Just use a vacuum cleaner or a clean cloth to remove dust. All seat cushions and backrests have zippers for easy cleaning. High metal legs can easily allow the sweeping robot to pass, without worrying about dust at the floor. 【Built to Last】 High-quality cotton linen will not wear out for many years. The wooden frame won’t crack and will last longer than the rubber wood. We have conducted in-house testing to guarantee the superior quality of our products. This sofa successfully passes durability test for seat, back and arm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZrIO0dG2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINLUX","source_asin":"B0B77G2FVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B77G2FVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B77G2FVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":984771,"name":"G Francis Large 'Red Wine' Glasses Set of 4-20oz Slant Rim Wine Glass with Long Stems Drinking Crystal Wine Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uCH6VZJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate your next party with the G Francis 4 Pack Asymmetric Slanted Edge Wine Glasses Gift Set. 4 pack wine glasses unique drinking glasses have a bulb shape to hold up to 20 ounces each, much more than a standard drink glasses. The large port glasses bowl also enhances the ability to release aromas when swirling the glass. Ultra-clear large slanted wine glasses allow optimal visibility of your favorite red and white wines including riesling, pinot, chardonnay, cabernet, shiraz, merlot, and more. With uniform rims and sophisticated lines, these beautiful big glass wine cups will make the perfect gift for the wine connoisseur in your life. [Unique Slanted Rim]: Impress your guests with the unique G Francis 4 Pack Extra Large Wine Glasses with Stems; 45 degree slanted drinking glasses add an elegant aesthetic to your event and have a 2.8 by 3-inch (7.1 x 7.6cm) wide rim for easy cleaning [Finest Crystal Wine Glasses]: Ultra-clear stemmed wine glasses made of premium crystal glass are safe for wine and other liquids; Thin, yet durable glass wine glasses are top-shelf dishwasher safe [Lightweight, Graceful Design]: 4.5-inch (11.4cm) elongated stems compliment the extra-wide 4-inch (10.2cm) wide red and white wine glasses bowls; Long stem wine glasses stand 9.7 inches (24.6cm) tall [For Red and White Wines]: Each long stem goblet can hold up to 20 ounces (591mL) of liquid; Wide bowls on modern wine glasses make it easy to swirl your red and white wines to aerate the aromas [Stable Base for Practical Use]: 3.5-inch (8.9cm) wide flat bottom wine glasses base ensures stability for a comfortable user experience; Add these large bulb wine glasses to your home bar or restaurant California Residents Prop 65 warning:Products may contain a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer, birth defects or other reproductive harm. This product has a manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship for a period of ONE (1) YEAR from the date of original retail purchase. See our Seller Return Policy for more details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uCH6VZJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G Francis","source_asin":"B0B3M68MNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3M68MNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3M68MNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
