window.products.push({"id":984808,"name":"YISIHUAN DIY Personalized Custom Shower Curtain Bathroom Sets, Upload Images or Photos of Your Design, Customize Your Personalized Bathroom (Shower Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PXpj-ERjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Makeover your bathroom with just a single touch! Start with these fun and decorative shower curtains. Print Your Own Shower Curtain: Every part of your home should reflect you and your personality, show it off with custom shower curtains, And it’s the perfect way to take your hot showers and steamy soaks to the next level. Convert your bathroom from top to bottom! Our Personalized Photo Shower Curtain is the perfect decorative and functional piece for your bathroom. Quality fabrics and state of the art digital imaging: 1. Lovingly handmade using 100% waterproof Polyester fabric, button-hole top creates a finished look for the piece. 2. Yield curtains with realistic durable images that don't change the feel of the fabric and the image will not fade, crack, or peel. 3. Launder repeatedly with no shrinkage or fading. Our curtains last a . A Gorgeous Gift for Loved Ones: The affordable photo bath curtain can be a thoughtful gift to friends and family, letting them always remember the happy time between you. A special gift for your family and friends on birthday, wedding day, anniversary, Halloween, Christmas, Thanksgiving day. How to Customize? 1 -- CLICK inchCustomize nowinch button 2 -- CLICK inchUpload your imageinch button 3 -- CLICK inchMy Computerinch button to upload picture 4 -- THEN CLICK inchAdd Textinch button, type your text if u need 5 -- Resize and Adjust Your Image and Text, Click inchADD TO CART inch to Finish. WARM TIPS: 1. High resolution images (minimum 2000 x 2000 pixels at 72 dpi) in clear focus with adequate contrast between subject and background will work best. 2.If there are some creases on shower curtain, please iron it gently. 3.The size may have a slight errors due to manual measurement. 4.Due to different monitors, the actual color may vary slightly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PXpj-ERjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YISIHUAN","source_asin":"B09B1VF8W2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1VF8W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1VF8W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
