window.products.push({"id":984941,"name":"ALTIUS HOME Elephant Cutlery Drainer | Toothbrush Holder, Silverware Drainer Caddy | Cute Unique Elephant Design | Sustainable Mango Wood | Premium Qu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x7RaOnlTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Very Special and Unique ProductThis elephant cutlery drainer and cute toothbrush holder is a lovely addition to any home, for effective silverware drying, utensil drying or storing toothbrushes. With an enamel coating on the inside to protect the mango wood during draining, excess water travels down the elephant trunk into the sink. It could have many more uses including as an electric toothbrush holder, for storing kitchen sink accessories, dish scrubber holder, toothbrush and toothpaste holder or toothbrush head holder.Easy to Clean – Simply wipe down periodically with a slightly damp or dry dust cloth that contains no heavy stitching, in order to avoid scratches. Care instructions are provided.If you are not completely satisfied with your product, we will provide a full money-back .Dimension DetailsDimensions are 5 inches overall width (including the elephant head), 3 inches wide (base), 4.25 inches high and 3.75 inches deep.About ALTIUS HOMEHere at ALTIUS Home, we pride ourselves on sourcing sustainable products of premium quality for our customers, that bestow a feeling of bliss. We aim to source products of sustainable origin.Special Properties of Mango WoodMango wood comes from the tropical tree that grows the mango fruit. Mango trees can be found across the globe, originally in Far East Asia. It is a wonderful product that is used for making goods after the mango tree stops producing its fruit, which happens 7 to 15 years after the tree is grown. Only trees that have stopped producing mangoes will be cut down for use in production. Creating products from mango wood relieves deforestation of endangered tree species such as teak and is a truly sustainable and product. Mango wood is a durable hardwood and natural markings are unique from one item to the next. It will slowly darken with age and has excellent water resistance properties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x7RaOnlTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALTIUS Home","source_asin":"B08NXSRPX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-984941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NXSRPX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NXSRPX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
